    "text": "Riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preostas beon geornlice Gode \u00feeowiende and \u00f0eniende and for eall cristen folc \u00f0ingiende,\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc wur\u00f0ie o\u00f0erne, and hyran \u00fea gingran georne heora yldrum, and lufian and l\u00e6ran \u00fea\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preostas on sino\u00f0e gif heom hw\u00e6t derige, and gif heom \u00e6nig man healice misboden\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preosta gehwylc on sinode gecy\u00f0e gyf he on his scriftscyre \u00e6nine man wite Gode\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t nan sacu \u00fee betweox preostum sy ne beo gescoten to woruldmanna some, ac seman and\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig preost sylfwilles ne forl\u00e6te \u00fea cyrican \u00fee he to gebletsod w\u00e6s, ac h\u00e6bbe \u00fea him to\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t nan preost o\u00f0rum ne \u00e6tdo \u00e6nig \u00fe\u00e6ra \u00feinga \u00fee him to gebyrige, ne on his mynstre, ne on\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig preost ne underfo scole butan \u00fe\u00e6s leafe \u00fee he \u00e6r folgade.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preosta gehwylc toeacan lare leornige handcr\u00e6ft georne.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig gel\u00e6red preost ne scende \u00feone saml\u00e6redan, ac gebete hine gif he bet cunne.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig for\u00f0boren preost ne forseo \u00feone l\u00e6sborenan, for\u00f0am gif hit man ariht asmea\u00fe,\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preosta gehwylc tylige him rihtlice, and ne beo \u00e6nig mangeara mid unrihte ne gytsiende\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preosta gehwylc fulluhtes and scriftes ty\u00f0ige sona swa man gyrne, and \u00e6ghw\u00e6r on his\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preosta gehwylc cristendom geornlice l\u00e6re and \u00e6lcne h\u00e6\u00feendom mid ealle adw\u00e6sce,\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc cristen man his bearn to cristendome geornlice wenige, and him pater noster and\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t man geswice freolsdagum h\u00e6\u00f0enra leo\u00f0a and deofles gamena.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t man geswice sunnand\u00e6ges cypincge.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t man geswice higleasra w\u00e6da and dyslicra ger\u00e6da, and bysmorlicra efesunge.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc man leornige \u00fe\u00e6t he cunne pater noster and credan, be \u00f0am \u00fee he wille on\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t freolsdagum and rihtf\u00e6stendagum \u00e6nig geflit ne beo betweox mannum.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t man freolsdagum and rihtf\u00e6stendagum forga a\u00feas and ordela.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc wer forga his wif freolstidum and rihtf\u00e6stenditum.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preostas cyrican healdan mid ealre arwyr\u00f0nysse to godcundre \u00feenunge and to cl\u00e6nan\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t man into cyrican \u00e6nig \u00feing ne logie \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6rto ungedafenlic sy.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00e6t cyricw\u00e6ccan swy\u00f0e dreoh sy, and georne gebidde, and \u00e6nig gedrync ne \u00e6nig\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t man innan cyrican \u00e6nine man ne byrige butan man wite \u00fe\u00e6t he on life Gode to \u00f0am wel\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig preost on \u00e6nigum huse ne m\u00e6ssige butan on gehalgodre cyrican, butan hyt sy for\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preost \u00e6fre ne m\u00e6ssige butan onufan gehalgodum weofode.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preost \u00e6fre ne m\u00e6ssige butan bec, ac beo se canon him \u00e6tforan eagum.\nBeseo to gyf he wylle, \u00fe\u00e6 l\u00e6ste him misse.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc preost h\u00e6bbe corporale \u00feonne he m\u00e6ssige and subumbrale under his alban, and eall\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc preost tylige georne \u00fe\u00e6t he gode and huru rihte bec h\u00e6bbe.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig m\u00e6ssepreost ana ne m\u00e6ssige, \u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6bbe \u00feone \u00fee him acwe\u00f0e.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig unf\u00e6stende man husles ne abyrige, butan hit for oferseocnysse sy.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig preost anes d\u00e6ges oftor ne m\u00e6ssige \u00feonne \u00feriwa m\u00e6stra \u00f0inga.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preost a geara husel h\u00e6bbe \u00feam \u00fee \u00feearf sy, and \u00fe\u00e6t georne on cl\u00e6nnysse healde, and\nGyf \u00f0onne hit forhealden sy, \u00fe\u00e6t his man brucan ne m\u00e6ge, \u00feonne forb\u00e6rne hit man on cl\u00e6num fyre,\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preost \u00e6fre ne ge\u00feristl\u00e6ce \u00fe\u00e6t he m\u00e6ssige butan he eall h\u00e6bbe \u00fe\u00e6t to husle gebyrige,\nWa \u00feam \u00fee m\u00e6ssan ongin\u00f0 butan he \u00e6lc \u00feara h\u00e6bbe, and wa \u00feam \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r ful to de\u00f0, for\u00f0am he de\u00f0\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6fre ne geweor\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t preost m\u00e6ssige and sylf \u00fe\u00e6t husel ne \u00feicge, ne man gehalgod\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc calic gegoten beo \u00fee man husel on halgige, and on treowenum ne halgige man \u00e6nig,\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t ealle \u00fea \u00f0ing \u00fee weofode neah beon and to cyrcan gebyrian beon swy\u00f0e cl\u00e6nlice and\nAnd a sy byrnende leoht on cyrican \u00feonne man m\u00e6ssan singe.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t man ne forgyme \u00e6nig gehalgod \u00feing, ne halig w\u00e6ter, ne sealt, ne stor, ne hlaf, ne\nAc forb\u00e6rne hit man on cl\u00e6num fyre, butan his man elles notian m\u00e6ge, and \u00f0a axan under weofode\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig wifman neah weofode ne cume \u00fea hwile \u00fee man m\u00e6ssige.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t man on rihtne timan tida hrincge, and preosta gehwylc \u00feonne his tidsang on cyrcan\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6ssapreosta nan ne cume gew\u00e6pned binnan cyrican dura, ne binnan weofodstealle\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig gehadod mann his sceare ne helige, ne hine misefesian ne l\u00e6te, ne his beard \u00e6nige\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t ealle preostas \u00e6t freolsan and \u00e6t f\u00e6stenan anr\u00e6de beon, and ealle on ane wisan beodan\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc f\u00e6sten beo mid \u00e6lmessan gewur\u00f0od, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t gehwa on Godes est \u00e6lmessan\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preostas on cyric\u00feenungum ealle an dreogan, and beon efenfor\u00f0e ofer geares f\u00e6c on\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preostas geogo\u00f0e geornlice l\u00e6ran, and to cr\u00e6ftum teon, \u00fe\u00e6t hy cyricfultum habban.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preostas \u00e6lce sunnand\u00e6ge folce bodian and a wel bysnian.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig cristen man blod ne \u00feycge.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preostas folc mynegian \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee hi Gode don sculon to gerihtum on teo\u00feungum and on\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00feisses mynegige to eastrum, o\u00f0re si\u00f0e to gangdagum, \u00feriddan si\u00f0e to middan\n\u00c6rest sulh\u00e6lmessan xv niht ofer eastran, geogo\u00f0e teo\u00f0unge be pentecosten, Romfeoh be Petres\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preostas swa d\u00e6lan folces \u00e6lmessan \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00e6g\u00f0er don ge God gegladian ge folc to\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t man bet\u00e6ce \u00e6nne d\u00e6l preostum, o\u00feerne d\u00e6l to cyricneode, \u00feriddan d\u00e6l \u00feam \u00feearfum.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preostas sealmas singan \u00feonne hy \u00f0a \u00e6lmessan d\u00e6lan, and \u00f0a \u00feearfan georne biddan\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preostas beorgen wi\u00f0 oferdruncen and hit georne belean o\u00f0rum mannum.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig preost ne beo ealusceop, ne on \u00e6nige wisan gliwige mid him sylfum o\u00f0rum\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preostas wi\u00f0 a\u00feas beorgan heom georne, and hi eac swy\u00fee forbeodan.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig preost ne stande on leasre gewitnesse, ne \u00feeofa gewita beo.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preost bis\u00e6ce ordol \u00e6fre ne ge\u00e6\u00fee.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preost wi\u00f0 \u00feegen ne ladige butan \u00feegenes fora\u00fee.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preost ne beo hunta ne hafecere ne t\u00e6flere, ac plege on his bocum swa his hade gebyra\u00f0.\nSe canon seg\u00f0 gyf hwylc gehadod man on hunta\u00fe fare, gyf hit bi\u00f0 clerec forga xii mona\u00f0 fl\u00e6sc, diacon\nAnd gyf hwylc bisceop o\u00f0\u00f0e m\u00e6ssepreost o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6nig gehadod man hine sylfne r\u00e6dlice oferdrince, o\u00f0\u00f0e\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preostas aa gearuwe beon to folces gerihtum.\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc preost scrife and d\u00e6dbote t\u00e6ce \u00feam \u00fee him andette, and eac to bote fylste, and\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig preost ne lufige wifmanna neawiste ealles to swi\u00fee, ac lufige his riht\u00e6we, \u00fe\u00e6t is\nAnd riht is gif weofod\u00feen his agen lif be boca t\u00e6cincge rihtlice fadige, \u00feonne sy he fulles \u00feegnscipes\nGyf he his lif misfadige, wanige his wyr\u00f0scipe be \u00f0am \u00fee seo d\u00e6d sy.\nWite, gif he wylle, ne gebyra\u00f0 him na\u00f0or ne to wife ne to woruldwige, gif he Gode wile rihtlice hyran\nDunstan gedemde \u00fe\u00e6t se m\u00e6ssepreost n\u00e6re, gif he wif h\u00e6fde, \u00e6nige o\u00f0re lade wyr\u00fee butan eallswa\nAnd riht is gyf weofod\u00feen hine hrihtlice healde, \u00feonne sy he fulles weres and wur\u00f0scipes wyr\u00f0e.\nAnd gyf hit gewur\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t man mid tihtlan and mid uncr\u00e6ftum sacerd belecge \u00fee regollice libbe, and he\nGif man diacon tihtlige, \u00fee regollice libbe, anfealdre spr\u00e6ce, nime twegen his gehadan and ladige hine\nAnd gif man folciscne m\u00e6ssepreost mid tihtlan belecge \u00fee regollif n\u00e6bbe, ladige hine swa diacon \u00fee\nAnd gyf man freondleasne weofod\u00feen mid tihtlan belecge \u00fee a\u00f0fultum n\u00e6bbe, ga to corsn\u00e6de, and \u00f0\u00e6r\nAnd gif man gehadodne mid f\u00e6h\u00f0e belecge, and secge \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re d\u00e6dbana, ladige mid his magum \u00fee\nAnd gyf he sy m\u00e6gleas, ladige mid geran o\u00f0\u00f0e on f\u00e6stan fo, gif he \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feurfe, and ga to corsn\u00e6de, and\nAnd riht is \u00fe\u00e6t preosta gehwylc \u00e6g\u00feer h\u00e6bbe ge fulluhtele ge seocum smerels, and a gearu sy to folces",
